{
  "id": "DAN.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Danieli 2",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 49,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chindoto chia Nebukadinesaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o kabere bw’okogamba kwa Nebukadinesaro ere akarota chindoto; ase ayio agachandeka ase ebirengererio biaye, tarara chitoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agachiika ng’a abaringoria na abaragori, na abarogi, amo n’Abakalidayo bamanyete oborogi, barentwe, erinde bamoteebie chindoto chiaye. Ase ayio abanto abwo bonsi bagaacha ase obosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akabateebia, “Narotete chindoto, na ebirengererio biane nigo bichandegete, Ninganetie monteebie chindoto chiria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalidayo baria bagateebia omorwoti ase omonwa bw’Ekearamaiki, “Aye omorwoti ochie kare! Toteebie intwe abasomba bao chindoto echio, na intwe ntonyare kogoteebia engencho yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akabairaneria, akabateebia, Amang’ana ane tari koonchoka, na motanteebeti chindoto chiane amo nengencho yaye, nigo morabutoranwe ekiimo ase ekiimo, ne chinyomba chiaino nchitagorwe chibe amatombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende komoranteebie chindoto chiria amo nengencho yaye, rirorio nimbae ebiegwa, na eng’eria, na amasikani amanene. Bono nteebie chindoto chiria amo nengencho yaye.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakairaneria omorwoti eria kabere, “Aye omorwoti, toteebie intwe abasomba bao chindoto chiria, na intwe ntogoteebie engencho yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akairaneria, akabateebia, “Ekeene, namanyire ng’a nigo moganetie koegwa chingaki, ekiagera mwamanyire ng’a amang’ana ane tari koonchoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende motanteebeti chindoto chiria, ogochika nkore okomo gwoka narure igoro yaino. Mwabeire mokobwatana ase ogonteebia oborimo na amang’ana y’obong’ainereria, mosemeretie ng’a chingaki nchionchorwe. Ase ayio goika monteebie aya narotete, erio nario ndamanye ng’a mwamanyire engencho yaye moyenteebie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalidayo baria bakairaneria omorwoti, bakamoteebia, “Monto onde tari ase ense eye oranyare koorokia ring’ana erio aye omorwoti oganetie komanya, ekiagera omorwoti onde tari, nonya ore omonene mono, gose ore nokobua kore naki, oboririe egento kenga buna ekio korwa ase abaringoria, gose abaragori, gose korwa ase Abakalidayo bamanyete oborogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egento eke aye omorwoti kwaboririe nigo kere egekong’u mono, na onde tari oranyare gokeorokia ase omorwoti otatiga chinyasae, na echio tichimenyeti amo na Mwanyabaanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho y’amang’ana ayio, omorwoti akaba nendamwamu na ekeririanda ekenene, agachiika ng’a abang’aini bonsi ba Babiloni basirigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ogochika gokaruegwa ng’a abanto abwo bonsi baitwe, na Danieli amo na baria bamwabo barigigwe baitwe boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae okworokia Danieli engencho ye chindoto chi’omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Arioki, omochiki bw’abarendi b’omorwoti, agendete ng’a aite abanto abang’aini ba Babiloni, Danieli agakwana nere ore nobong’aini na obomanyi bw’amasikani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamobooria, “Nase ki omorwoti arure ogochika ogotindi iga?” Erio Arioki agateebia Danieli amang’ana onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli akagenda ase obosio bw’omorwoti, akamosaba amoe engaki achiche komoteebia engencho ye chindoto chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Danieli akairana gochia inka, agateebia Hanania, na Mishaeli, na Asaria, abamwabo, amang’ana aria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabateebia ng’a basabe Nyasae ore igoro abarorere amaabera, aborokie obobisi boria, erinde ere omonyene na baria bamwabo tibasirigwa amo nabaanto baria abang’aini bande ba Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obobisi boria bokamaanorwa ase Danieli ase okorora kwa botuko. Ase ayio Danieli akamotogia Nyasae ore igoro, agateeba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erieta ria Nyasae ritogigwe goika kare na kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini na okobua nebiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo akoonchora ebiro ne chingaki;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo akorusia abarwoti, naende obeka abande;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo akoa abang’aini obong’aini bwabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na abamanyi okomanya kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo akoorokia ay’obobisi bwa ime,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo amanyete ayare ime ase omosunte;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na omobaso nigo ore amo nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nagoakeire ng’a mbuya mono na kogotogia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekiagera aye kwang’eire obong’aini ne chinguru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bono kwamanyirie inche aya twagosabete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekiagera gwatoorokeirie aya omorwoti aganetie komanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danieli ogoteebia omorwoti chindoto chiaye na engencho ya chirochio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio Danieli akagenda ase Arioki, oria omorwoti achorete ng’a aite abanto abang’aini ba Babiloni, akamoteebia, “Tobaisa goita abang’aini ba Babiloni; ng’ire ase obosio bw’omorwoti, imoteebie engencho ye chindoto chiria.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bwango Arioki akaira Danieli ase obosio bw’omorwoti, akamoteebia, “Nanyorire omonto korwa ase egati yabooswa baria b’Abayuda oranyare kogoteebia aye omorwoti engencho ye chindoto chiao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akaboria Danieli, oria orogetwe Beli‐Tesasari, “Inee! Aye nonyare gonteebia chindoto echio narotete na engencho yaye?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli akairaneria omorwoti, akamoteebia, “Onde tari ase abanto abang’aini, gose abaragori, gose abaringoria, gose abanto bamanyete igoro ye ching’enang’eni oranyare koorokia obobisi obo aye omorwoti kwaboririe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende Nyasae ore igoro nere oranyare koorokia obobisi. Nere orakomanyie aye omorwoti Nebukadinesaro amang’ana agochia gokorekana ase amatuko agochi‐gocha. Chindoto chiao na okorora kwarora, ekero kwaraire borere, nachio echi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omorwoti, ekero kwaraire borere bwao, okarengereria amang’ana agochia gokorekana ase amatuko agochi‐gocha, na ere oria okoorokia obobisi nigo agokomanyia amang’ana agochia gokorekana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono obobisi obo bwamaanoirwe ase inde, tari ng’a inche nigo imbwate obong’aini goetania abanto bande bonsi bare moyo, korende ng’a aye omorwoti omanyigwe engencho ye chindoto chiria, naende onyare komanya ebirengererio bire ase omoyo oo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omorwoti, ase okorora kwao okarora omogwekano omonene mono, oteneine ase obosio bwao. Omogwekano oyio nigo orenge omotambe, okomeka‐meka noborabu obonene, na okororekana kwaye nigo kwarenge gw’okoondokia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omotwe bw’omogwekano oria nigo oroisetigwe korwa ase etaabu engiya mono; egekuba kiaye na amaboko aye nigo biaroisetigwe korwa ase chifeta, na enda yaye na amariagati aye nigo biaroisetigwe korwa ase chitaai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagoro aye nigo aroisetigwe korwa ase ebioma, na ebisanyi bi’amagoro nigo biarenge ekeng’ese ki’ebioma, na ekeng’ese ki’amaroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero kwarigereretie okarora rigena rigotegoka ritakuniri namaboko a Mwanyabaanto, rigaaka amagoro y’omogwekano oria arenge ay’ebioma na amaroba, rikayasamunyora akaba ebisamunye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ebioma biria, na amaroba, ne chitaai, ne chifeta, ne chitaabu, bionsi ebio bigasamunyoranwa, bikaba buna omoiruro ore ase ekeooreri ekero ki’egura‐gura. Omwaga okairurukia ebinto biria gochia aare nonya nokoba kwabo tikwarorekana aande. Korende rigena riria riaagete omogwekano oria rigakiina, rikaba egetunwa ekenene kegaichora ase ense engima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oko nakwo okorota kwarotete, na bono intwe ntogoteebie aye omorwoti engencho yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti nigo ore omonene goetania abarwoti bande. Nyasae ore igoro okoeire oborwoti, na okobua, ne chinguru, na obonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende obekire Mwanyabaanto ase amaboko ao obagambere aande onsi ase bamenyete; okobekire ogambere boigo ching’iti chi’ense ne chinyoni chionsi; na omotwe oria bw’etaabu kwarooche n’oro aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa magega yao oborwoti bonde bore oboke ase obwao mbooroke, na magega y’oborwoti obwo, obonde bwa gatato bore obw’etai mbooroke, na borobwo mbogambere ense yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende oborwoti bwa kane mbooroke, bore obokong’u buna ekioma kegoaka na gosenyenta ebinto bionsi. Buna koreng’ana ekioma kegosenyenta ebinto, oborwoti boria nabo borasenyente na gosiria onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buna kwarooche ebisanyi na ebiara bi’amagoro biarenge ekeng’ese ki’amaroba na ekeng’ese ki’ebioma, engencho yaye nero eye: Oborwoti obwo mbwatananekane. Korende chinsemo chinde chire chinkong’u buna ekioma nachibe ime ase oborwoti obwo, buna koreng’ana kwarora ekioma keburukaine namaroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na buna ebiara bi’amagoro biarenge ekeng’ese ki’ebioma na ekeng’ese ki’amaroba, naboigo oborwoti boria borabe obokong’u ensemo eyemo, na ensemo ende obworo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buna kwarora ekioma keria keburukaine namaroba, naboigo abanto barasang’anane ase okonyuomerana, korende tibakonyara kobwatana amo buna koreng’ana ekioma getari kobwatana namaroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko y’abarwoti abwo Nyasae ore igoro narente oborwoti botanyare gosarigwa, gose okobua kw’oborwoti obwo tibokoegwa egesaku kende. Obwo mbosenyente amarwoti onsi na koyasiria, na borobwo obonyene mbogenderere kobao goika kare na kare,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buna koreng’ana kwarooche rigena rigotegoka rinyene korwa ase egetunwa, ritategoiri namaboko ya Mwanyabaanto, ne rigena riria rigaaka na gosamunyora ekioma, na etai, na amaroba, na efeta, na etaabu. Nyasae ore omonene okomanyirie aye omorwoti amang’ana agochi‐gocha. Chindoto chiao nechi’ekeene, na engencho yaye nagotebirie ney’ekeene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti okoa Danieli obonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nebukadinesaro omorwoti akagwa inse maumama, akaorokia amasikani ase Danieli, agachiika ng’a ekeng’wanso na ubani biruegwe ase Danieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agateebia Danieli, “Ekeene, Nyasae oino nere Nyasae ore igoro ye chinyasae chionsi, n’Omonene bw’abarwoti, naende nere okomaanora obobisi. Namanyire aya, ekiagera aye kwamaanoire obobisi obo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti akaa Danieli amasikani amanene, na ebiegwa ebinene ebinge, naende akamobeka akaba omogambi igoro ase orogongo rwonsi rwa Babiloni na omoteneneri omonene igoro y’abang’aini bonsi ba Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli akaboria Nebukadinesaro, na ere akabeeka Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, bakaba abanene igoro ase amang’ana y’orogongo rwa Babiloni, korende Danieli akabeera ase enyomba y’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
